response:
The report details cyberattacks occurring on 15 February 2022 against Ukrainian banking institutions, government systems, and internet infrastructure. The incidents involved phishing/fake messages, DDoS attacks using Mirai and Meris botnets (leveraging compromised MikroTik devices), DNS DDoS targeting gov.ua, and suspicious BGP route announcements involving PrivatBank and Nigerian network prefixes.

